_id":"d123ef7e-1362-4a19-bd1f-e5cbb245a4b4","search_result_idx":null,"evidence_text":"","start_line_num":132,"end_line_num":140,"connector_source":null},"og_tags":null}},{"start_ix":9117,"end_ix":9131,"citation_format_type":"tether_v4","metadata":{"type":"webpage","title":"3D web design best practices: a complete guide to immersive web experiences in 2026 | Verox Studio","url":"https://www.veroxstudio.com/blog/3d-web-design-best-practices-a-complete-guide-to-immersive-web-experiences-in-2#:~:text=Implement%20these%20three,optimization%20techniques","text":"Implement these three.js web design optimization techniques:","pub_date":null,"extra":{"cited_message_idx":15,"cited_message_id":"d123ef7e-1362-4a19-bd1f-e5cbb245a4b4","search_result_idx":null,"evidence_text":"","start_line_num":130,"end_line_num":138,"connector_source":null},"og_tags":null}},{"start_ix":9287,"end_ix":9301,"citation_format_type":"tether_v4","metadata":{"type":"webpage","title":"3D web design best practices: a complete guide to immersive web experiences in 2026 | Verox Studio","url":"https://www.veroxstudio.com/blog/3d-web-design-best-practices-a-complete-guide-to-immersive-web-experiences-in-2#:~:text=3D%20web%20experiences%20face%20a,negotiable","text":"3D web experiences face a fundamental tension: visual ambition versus performance reality. Research indicates that 53% of mobile users abandon sites that take more than three seconds to load. This makes performance optimization non-negotiable.","pub_date":null,"extra":{"cited_message_idx":15,"cited_message_id":"d123ef7e-1362-4a19-bd1f-e5cbb245a4b4","search_result_idx":null,"evidence_text":"","start_line_num":125,"end_line_num":133,"connector_source":null},"og_tags":null}},{"start_ix":9398,"end_ix":9412,"citation_format_type":"tether_v4","metadata":{"type":"webpage","title":"3D web design best practices: a complete guide to immersive web experiences in 2026 | Verox Studio","url":"https://www.veroxstudio.com/blog/3d-web-design-best-practices-a-complete-guide-to-immersive-web-experiences-in-2#:~:text=Implement%20these%20three,optimization%20techniques","text":"Implement these three.js web design optimization techniques:","pub_date":null,"extra":{"cited_message_idx":15,"cited_message_id":"d123ef7e-1362-4a19-bd1f-e5cbb245a4b4","search_result_idx":null,"evidence_text":"","start_line_num":130,"end_line_num":138,"connector_source":null},"og_tags":null}},{"start_ix":9475,"end_ix":9489,"citation_format_type":"tether_v4","metadata":{"type":"webpage","title":"3D web design best practices: a complete guide to immersive web experiences in 2026 | Verox Studio","url":"https://www.veroxstudio.com/blog/3d-web-design-best-practices-a-complete-guide-to-immersive-web-experiences-in-2#:~:text=Texture%20Optimization%3A%20Compress%20textures%20using,field%20viewing","text":"Texture Optimization: Compress textures using WebP or basis formats. For most web applications, 1024x1024 textures suffice. Avoid uncompressed formats unless specifically required for near-field viewing.","pub_date":null,"extra":{"cited_message_idx":15,"cited_message_id":"d123ef7e-1362-4a19-bd1f-e5cbb245a4b4","search_result_idx":null,"evidence_text":"","start_line_num":136,"end_line_num":140,"connector_source":null},"og_tags":null}},{"start_ix":9568,"end_ix":9582,"citation_format_type":"tether_v4","metadata":{"type":"webpage","title":"3D web design best practices: a complete guide to immersive web experiences in 2026 | Verox Studio","url":"https://www.veroxstudio.com/blog/3d-web-design-best-practices-a-complete-guide-to-immersive-web-experiences-in-2#:~:text=Lazy%20Loading%3A%20Defer%203D%20content,than%20blocking%20initial%20page%20render","text":"Lazy Loading: Defer 3D content loading until needed. A product configurator might load its 3D model only when users click \"customize,\" rather than blocking initial page render.","pub_date":null,"extra":{"cited_message_idx":15,"cited_message_id":"d123ef7e-1362-4a19-bd1f-e5cbb245a4b4","search_result_idx":null,"evidence_text":"","start_line_num":140,"end_line_num":147,"connector_source":null},"og_tags":null}},{"start_ix":9667,"end_ix":9681,"citation_format_type":"tether_v4","metadata":{"type":"webpage","title":"3D web design best practices: a complete guide to immersive web experiences in 2026 | Verox Studio","url":"https://www.veroxstudio.com/blog/3d-web-design-best-practices-a-complete-guide-to-immersive-web-experiences-in-2#:~:text=Frame%20Rate%20Management%3A%20Target%2060fps,time%20performance","text":"Frame Rate Management: Target 60fps for smooth interaction, but implement adaptive quality that reduces resolution or effect complexity when performance drops. Tools like stats.js help monitor real-time performance.","pub_date":null,"extra":{"cited_message_idx":15,"cited_message_id":"d123ef7e-1362-4a19-bd1f-e5cbb245a4b4","search_result_idx":null,"evidence_text":"","start_line_num":144,"end_line_num":147,"connector_source":null},"og_tags":null}},{"start_ix":9739,"end_ix":9753,"citation_format_type":"tether_v4","metadata":{"type":"webpage","title":"3D web design best practices: a complete guide to immersive web experiences in 2026 | Verox Studio","url":"https://www.veroxstudio.com/blog/3d-web-design-best-practices-a-complete-guide-to-immersive-web-experiences-in-2#:~:text=Frame%20Rate%20Management%3A%20Target%2060fps,time%20performance","text":"Frame Rate Management: Target 60fps for smooth interaction, but implement adaptive quality that reduces resolution or effect complexity when performance drops. Tools like stats.js help monitor real-time performance.","pub_date":null,"extra":{"cited_message_idx":15,"cited_message_id":"d123ef7e-1362-4a19-bd1f-e5cbb245a4b4","search_result_idx":null,"evidence_text":"","start_line_num":144,"end_line_num":147,"connector_source":null},"og_tags":null}},{"start_ix":9877,"end_ix":9891,"citation_format_type":"tether_v4","metadata":{"type":"webpage","title":"Three.js vs Unity for Web | Comparison Guide 2026","url":"https://www.utsubo.com/blog/threejs-vs-unity-web-comparison#:~:text=Three,WASM%20engine%20before%20anything%20renders","text":"Three.js loads like a regular website—progressive, streamable, with assets fetched on demand. Unity WebGL requires downloading and decompiling the entire WASM engine before anything renders.","pub_date":null,"extra":{"cited_message_idx":38,"cited_message_id":"acd5fafd-d360-4fd2-87e5-d232ef8a34c1","search_result_idx":null,"evidence_text":"","start_line_num":178,"end_line_num":184,"connector_source":null},"og_tags":null}},{"start_ix":10281,"end_ix":10295,"citation_format_type":"tether_v4","metadata":{"type":"webpage","title":"3D web design best practices: a complete guide to immersive web experiences in 2026 | Verox Studio","url":"https://www.veroxstudio.com/blog/3d-web-design-best-practices-a-complete-guide-to-immersive-web-experiences-in-2#:~:text=Progressive%20Disclosure%3A%20Introduce%203D%20complexity,while%20preserving%20the%20immersive%20potential","text":"Progressive Disclosure: Introduce 3D complexity gradually. Start with simple rotations or hover effects; reveal deeper interactions as users demonstrate interest. This prevents overwhelm while preserving the immersive potential.","pub_date":null,"extra":{"cited_message_idx":15,"cited_message_id":"d123ef7e-1362-4a19-bd1f-e5cbb245a4b4","search_result_idx":null,"evidence_text":"","start_line_num":153,"end_line_num":162,"connector_source":null},"og_tags":null}},{"start_ix":10417,"end_ix":10431,"citation_format_type":"tether_v4","metadata":{"type":"webpage","title":"3D web design best practices: a complete guide to immersive web experiences in 2026 | Verox Studio","url":"https://www.veroxstudio.com/blog/3d-web-design-best-practices-a-complete-guide-to-immersive-web-experiences-in-2#:~:text=Progressive%20Disclosure%3A%20Introduce%203D%20complexity,while%20preserving%20the%20immersive%20potential","text":"Progressive Disclosure: Introduce 3D complexity gradually. Start with simple rotations or hover effects; reveal deeper interactions as users demonstrate interest. This prevents overwhelm while preserving the immersive potential.","pub_date":null,"extra":{"cited_message_idx":15,"cited_message_id":"d123ef7e-1362-4a19-bd1f-e5cbb245a4b4","search_result_idx":null,"evidence_text":"","start_line_num":153,"end_line_num":162,"connector_source":null},"og_tags":null}},{"start_ix":10558,"end_ix":10572,"citation_format_type":"tether_v4","metadata":{"type":"webpage","title":"3D web design best practices: a complete guide to immersive web experiences in 2026 | Verox Studio","url":"https://www.veroxstudio.com/blog/3d-web-design-best-practices-a-complete-guide-to-immersive-web-experiences-in-2#:~:text=Fallback%20Strategies%3A%20Not%20every%20browser,Firefox%2C%20Safari%2C%20and%20mobile%20browsers","text":"Fallback Strategies: Not every browser or device handles WebGL equally. Implement graceful degradation—static images or video alternatives for unsupported configurations. Test across Chrome, Firefox, Safari, and mobile browsers.","pub_date":null,"extra":{"cited_message_idx":15,"cited_message_id":"d123ef7e-1362-4a19-bd1f-e5cbb245a4b4","search_result_idx":null,"evidence_text":"","start_line_num":161,"end_line_num":164,"connector_source":null},"og_tags":null}},{"start_ix":10668,"end_ix":10682,"citation_format_type":"tether_v4","metadata":{"type":"webpage","title":"3D web design best practices: a complete guide to immersive web experiences in 2026 | Verox Studio","url":"https://www.veroxstudio.com/blog/3d-web-design-best-practices-a-complete-guide-to-immersive-web-experiences-in-2#:~:text=Reduced%20Motion%20Preferences%3A%20Respect%20the,users%20who%20specify%20this%20preference","text":"Reduced Motion Preferences: Respect the `prefers-reduced-motion` media query. Provide static alternatives or reduced animation versions for users who specify this preference.","pub_date":null,"extra":{"cited_message_idx":15,"cited_message_id":"d123ef7e-1362-4a19-bd1f-e5cbb245a4b4","search_result_idx":null,"evidence_text"